{
  "key": 29747,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "A thief broke into the Power Plant...\n",
        "What is the world coming to?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "I just got word from Cerulean.\n",
        "It appears that a shady character has\f",
        "been loitering around.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Could I ask for your cooperation?\r",
        "The shady character was hanging around\n",
        "the Cerulean Gym...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Could I ask for your cooperation?\r",
        "The shady character was hanging around\n",
        "the Cerulean Gym..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Someone made off with a part that’s\n",
        "essential for the generator.\r",
        "Without it, the new generator’s\n",
        "useless!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "This Power Plant had been abandoned in\n",
        "the past.\r",
        "We got it back up and running to provide\n",
        "power to the Magnet Train."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "The Power Plant’s Manager is up ahead.\r",
        "But since someone wrecked the\n",
        "generator, he’s been both sad and,\f",
        "at times, furious...\r",
        "Sometimes he would burst out laughing\n",
        "out of desperation.\f",
        "We’ve had to go through so much..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "The Magnet Train consumes a lot\n",
        "of electricity.\r",
        "It can’t move if the new generator\n",
        "isn’t operating."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "I collect Pokémon.\n",
        "Do you have a DUGTRIO?\r",
        "Want to trade it for my MAGNETON? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Yay! I got myself a DUGTRIO!\n",
        "Thanks!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? That’s not DUGTRIO.\n",
        "What a letdown..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00011",
      "en_US": "You don’t want to trade? Aww..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00012",
      "en_US": "Hi, how’s my old MAGNETON doing?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Manager: I-I-I’m ready to blast\n",
        "something!\r",
        "Who would dare steal a part from the\n",
        "generator?\r",
        "I spent so much time fixing it!\n",
        "If I catch him, he’s going to see\f",
        "what I can do with my Charge Beam!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Manager: Ah! Yeah!\n",
        "The thing you have...\r",
        "Is that the part that was stolen from\n",
        "my beloved generator?\r",
        "You found it?\n",
        "Thank you so much!\r",
        "Now, all I have to do is...\n",
        "attach this part here...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Manager: Whirrrrrr!\r",
        "Yes, it’s running!\n",
        "Whirrr, whirrr!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Manager: Wahah! Thanks!\r",
        "Here! Go ahead and take this TM\n",
        "as a reward!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Manager: TM57 is my Charge Beam!\r",
        "It will shoot beams, and it can also\n",
        "sometimes raise Special Attack!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Staff Mottos:\r",
        "1. Electricity is not infinite.\n",
        "2. Conserve wherever possible.\f",
        "3. Watch out for each other.\f",
        "4. Idle hands are not allowed.\f",
        "5. Wear shoes with rubber soles.\f",
        "6. The Manager is awesome."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0345_R10R0202_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Use electricity wisely\n",
        "for a bright and pleasant life.\f",
        "           Kanto Power Plant"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
